# No environment variables are required for this project.
# The bundled Chromium binary (@sparticuz/chromium) includes all necessary
# system libraries and requires no external configuration.
#
# If you need to customize the Puppeteer behavior, you can set:
# PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH — path to a custom Chromium/Chrome binary
# PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD=1 — skip browser download during npm install
